libxc 7.0.0 (src/maple2c/{lda,gga}_exc and src/util.h), an MPL-2.0 component.
The file retains the applicable MPL notice and util.h copyright notices:
Copyright (C) 2006-2007 M.A.L. Marques
Copyright (C) 2019 X. Andrade

Source: https://gitlab.com/libxc/libxc/-/tree/7.0.0
License: https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
Source hashes and reproduction instructions are in the generated header
and ciderpress/gpu/generate_libxc.py. Changes fix default parameters and
adapt declarations/output pointers for CUDA; arithmetic order is preserved.
